        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "***PLEASE READ THE LEASE BEFORE SIGNING*** because everything is fine unless you want to leave and break your lease. It will cost you dearly...VERY dearly!!!! I had a small 660 sq ft workshop, and when I left, it was immaculate, in the same condition as a brand new place. They sent me a hefty bill saying they had to repaint the entire place! They said I wasn't allowed to fill small holes or repaint myself. It's the same as if you get burgled; they charge you $900 to change a lock! Several people have been ripped off. I bitterly regretted doing business with them.",
